00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,080
and how you're doing your processes.

165
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:23,800
So everyone on the team should know it, not just in a more

166
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:26,120
traditional manner, a project manager knowing what all the

167
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,880
