00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:33,240
So through the process, you are taking a look at all the

170
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:37,480
artifacts you created, so those backlog items, task lists,

171
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:40,600
things like that that you're creating during the process.

172
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,560
You're inspecting it, and in particular, you're inspecting

173
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,480
it during meetings.

174
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:46,360
So you're taking a look at what you've done in a meeting and

175
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,840
talking about it.

176
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,000
So you're not just doing a process.

177
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,440
You're doing a process, and you're talking about it, and

178
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:54,320
you're actively thinking about the process.

179
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,320
And then you're adapting.

180
00:07:55,320 --> 00:08:01,120
So based on evidence, based on needs, changes in needs, you

181
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,720
are changing that process.

