00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:17,160
Anything else?

212
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,560
So it's a collection of individuals.

213
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,800
So it's a group of people.

214
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,720
They're working toward a common purpose.

215
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:24,200
They have shared responsibility for common outcomes.

216
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,240
If one of those puppies trips, that stick

