00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:38,680
Shared responsibility, common purpose, common outcome.

220
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:38,920
All right.

221
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:42,080
So teams evolve over time.

222
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:45,320
And the little bit of research I'm going to talk about

223
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:49,920
actually comes from studying group behaviors.

224
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:53,880
But this is all from about the 1960s and on up.

225
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:56,560
And around the 2000s, and I'll post this reading up,

226
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,800
it was proven, or there was some studies showing that this

227
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,720
actually works for teams.

228
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,560
This does work for people who have a common goal.

229
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:04,040
But as you get a bunch of people together,

230
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,560
and you get a small group of people together,

231
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:08,440
and in our terms, we're calling a small group of people

